Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:28:52 +0800
Subject: [RFC PATCH 5/5] debug ec completion events

Correlate sampled EC shard operations and completion events with
messenger events to identify the last required remote shard and its send
waits. Requires patches 0003 and 0004.

Assisted-by: GPT-6 (OpenAI)
Signed-off-by: Li Lingfeng <a1151488180@gmail.com>
